  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 3.0.6 expands FormulaEngineer from a formula engine and streaming XLSX reader/writer into a complete .NET Excel solution.\n\n\t\t\tNew capabilities include:\n\t\t\t- Core styling: fonts, fills, borders, number formats, alignment, and protection\n\t\t\t- Layout and streaming auto-fit: row layout, column layout, default styles, and deterministic auto-fit\n\t\t\t- Advanced reporting: conditional formatting, rich text, named styles, themes, and Excel tables\n\t\t\t- Workbook collaboration objects: traditional notes and modern threaded comments\n\t\t\t- Workbook presentation objects: images, shapes, charts, and sparklines\n\t\t\t- Continued high-performance streaming workbook creation and formula evaluation without Excel or COM\n\n\t\t\tThe existing ExcelWriter, ExcelReader, and formula evaluation APIs remain supported.",
